Notes for this directory:

  This directory contains LKM-based LSM version of CaitSith which was derived
  from non-LSM version of CaitSith 0.1.11. This branch was developed for
  inclusion into mainline, but is currently using hacks used by AKARI.

Notes for Linux 2.6.29 and 2.6.30 kernels:

  CaitSith in this directory and AKARI cannot work together due to lack of
  security_bprm_free() LSM hook.
